# Paladin en-Vec, protection from black and from red (CR 702.16f): it can't be blocked by creatures that are black or red. Attacking
# on turn 3 into Bot2's black Dregscape Zombie, red Dragon Moose and colorless Ornithopter, a block by the Zombie and a block by
# the Moose are each refused, and the Ornithopter (the control) blocks and is killed by the first striker, so no damage is dealt
# to Bot2, who keeps 20 life.

